DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ssssddffbb driver supports OLED display modules based on the Solomon Sys‐
     tech SSD1306 or SSD1309 chips.  The support for partial updates in both
     the chip and the driver improves the display's responsiveness.  Due to
     the small resolution of about 128x64 the display makes most sense as a
     text-based terminal.

